! XRT-15 CE1(IOL・据付・変更しない)= お客さま A。Loopback100 = お客さまの LAN(試験のトラフィックの発信元)。
interface Loopback100
 description customer A LAN
 ip address 192.168.100.1 255.255.255.0
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to PE2 (primary)
 ip address 172.16.1.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description to XR01 (backup)
 ip address 172.16.2.2 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 172.16.1.254
ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 172.16.2.1 250
!
